<h2 style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 18px; color: #dc2626;">
  Booking Cancelled
</h2>
<p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #475569; margin: 0 0 20px;">
  Hello <%= @user.name.presence || "Customer" %>, your booking for <strong><%= @service.name %></strong> (<%= @booking.reference_number %>) has been cancelled.
</p>

<div class="detail-box">
  <table style="width: 100%;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">Booking Reference:</td>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #0f172a; text-align: right;"><%= @booking.reference_number %></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #64748b;">Reason:</td>
      <td style="padding: 6px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #dc2626; text-align: right;"><%= @reason %></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6;">
  If you have already paid for this booking, any refundable amount will be processed back to your original payment method within 5-7 business days.
</p>

<p style="text-align: center; margin: 28px 0 16px;">
  <a href="<%= @portal_url %>" class="btn-primary">Book Another Service</a>
</p>
